{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T10:08:03.326Z","ordinal":68067,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_02692a5b008ee3bd016ac619f25cf887d0964dd1231a965b09","status":"completed","call_id":"call_0WmpoHkswBHUUnj0X2P1mnGR","name":"exec","input":"const evidence=\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/d9cadb664291b327cf3e3cb624d40c511d78a384/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-native-operation-handover.json\";\nconst comment=await tools.mcp__codex_apps__linear_save_comment({issueId:\"54c5850f-f547-48d8-9803-35e5c60103fa\",body:`[Draft #163](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/163) is pushed at \\`d9cadb664291b327cf3e3cb624d40c511d78a384\\` and ready for Cooper review. The deployment and recovery instructions now match the local Alchemy commands and complete provider reads.\\n\\nFull local verification passes the unchanged source \\`226c60bddb225467db64e772d48304af2368a216\\` in 684.12 seconds, including 273 deployment tests, 34 workflow tests and 14 freshly built Website/API cases. All 1,750 file/link identities matched. The final four documentation/task/evidence files pass five focused checks; the other 1,746 identities are unchanged. Earlier failed formatting and evidence-path checks stay recorded. [Evidence and limits](${evidence}).\\n\\nDEV-78 is In Review; T007’s named preparation outcomes are locally accepted. No new cloud, credential or app deployment occurred. An executed rollback and empty repeat plan remain unproved. Continue the accepted analytics work; metrics and the separate Cloudflare browser beacon remain deferred. Retained tax results are unchanged. No merge or package publication.`});store(\"dev78handoverComment\",comment);text(comment);\nconst update=await tools.mcp__codex_apps__linear_save_status_update({type:\"project\",project:\"4e0eb6ef-1871-46d4-8f47-9c8f52a9c069\",health:\"onTrack\",body:`Maintainers now have checked instructions for running TaxKit deployments from this Mac. They cover the existing credentials and shared state, full provider reads, exact plan review and recovery steps. No action is required from calculator users.\\n\\n[Draft #163](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/163) is ready for Cooper review, and [DEV-78](https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-78) is In Review. Complete local verification passed, including the freshly built Website/API tests. The [handover receipt](${evidence}) records the exact source, failed attempts, passing checks and limits. This documentation update made no new provider, credential or deployment change. Cloud rollback and an empty repeat plan remain separate unproved outcomes.\\n\\nThe [live agent guide](https://taxkit.dev/api/agent-tools) and both deployments retain the earlier #162 evidence. Next is the agreed minimal page/calculator-name analytics. Read-only preparation found no TaxKit PostHog project or PostHog setting in TaxKit’s secret store, so project setup will have a separate concrete approval step. Ordinary Preview and local capture stay off. Metrics remain deferred, including the separately observed Cloudflare browser beacon. Retained tax results remain unchanged while the Medicare decision is outstanding; final rebuild acceptance remains incomplete.`});store(\"dev78handoverProjectWrite\",update);text(update);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a11571-1a58-7282-903b-860cd96057b2","create_time":1791367659.373824}}}
