{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T10:54:21.720Z","ordinal":68783,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a11600-0218-7731-bec8-e3525524133e","call_id":"call_6WrnehqfDZDKLiZGGs4bR79s","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.8 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-79\\\",\\\"uuid\\\":\\\"85150329-9061-4690-8f80-bfbc7af57ebe\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T008 — Track visits and calculator choice with minimal PostHog events\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"This issue tracks `CSF-T008` in the clean-slate rebuild plan.\\\\n\\\\nCooper wants traffic and calculator-use counts without sending the figures people enter or adding consent dialogs.\\\\n\\\\nWork to do:\\\\n\\\\n* Manage TaxKit Production and shared Preview PostHog projects through Alchemy with checked ownership and region.\\\\n* Send explicit pageviews from the website and one calculator_used event from the backend after a successful hosted calculation. Record which calculator was used, never its inputs or answer.\\\\n* Use a checked final field allowlist, memory-only browser identity and Do Not Track support. Disable automatic clicks, profiles, recordings and other unwanted capture; keep ordinary local/Preview capture off.\\\\n* Use the bounded same-origin event relay and owned Effect HTTP operations. Check the actual SDK transport, enrichment, retry identity and disposal so adapters do not count one action twice.\\\\n\\\\nAccept when:\\\\n\\\\n* Actual outbound payloads contain only approved page/usage fields, with no tax figures, free text or persistent browser identity.\\\\n* A successful calculation has one event owner; pure tax packages and local SDK use send no analytics.\\\\n* No consent dialog is introduced. Any provider event readback is proved separately in an approved Preview.\\\\n\\\\nRequired commands are recorded in the owning task: `bun run test`, `bun run test:oxlint`, `bun run check-types`, `bun run build`, `bun run check:docs`, `bun run check:runbooks`, `bun run verification`.\\\\n\\\\nDepends on `CSF-T004`, `CSF-T005`, `CSF-T006`. These will also be saved as native issue blockers.\\\\n\\\\nImplementation has started under Cooper’s approved continuation; the old whole-design hold is superseded. The prerequisite slices are locally accepted and delivered as reviewable drafts, including the deployed agent guide in <pull-request id=\\\\\\\"ebc88fb2-91a4-4b08-b8a7-503c330a40e5\\\\\\\" href=\\\\\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/review/dev-77-document-agent-setup-and-tested-cancellation-limits-4a0a6d3df773\\\\\\\">crcorbett/taxkit#162</pull-request> and checked deployment handover in <pull-request id=\\\\\\\"cf1c9900-6ac0-49aa-84a5-26d6fd1cff23\\\\\\\" href=\\\\\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/review/dev-78-align-native-deployment-handover-with-tested-local-operations-9525610e0f85\\\\\\\">crcorbett/taxkit#163</pull-request>. Current PostHog browser SDK 1.438.2 and Distilled 1.0.0-rc.13 have been read from their official registry archives; installed Effect/Alchemy compatibility and actual transport still need local qualification. Read-only preparation finds the Cooper US organisation but no TaxKit project among its six accessible projects, and no PostHog configuration in taxkit/prd or taxkit/stg_preview. Prepare the private event rules, one backend successful-use owner, browser lifetime and bounded relay locally. Local/ordinary Preview capture stays disabled. New project setup, management credential and exact stored-event proof remain separate concrete provider operations; no provider or credential has been changed. Metrics remain deferred.\\\\n\\\\nOwning [task and checks](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json#L607>), [design](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md>) and [planning commit](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/commit/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b>).\\\",\\\"priority\\\":{\\\"value\\\":0,\\\"name\\\":\\\"No priority\\\"},\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-79/csf-t008-track-visits-and-calculator-choice-with-minimal-posthog\\\",\\\"gitBranchName\\\":\\\"coopercorbett/dev-79-csf-t008-track-visits-and-calculator-choice-with-minimal\\\",\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-04T00:14:08.681Z\\\",\\\"updatedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-07T10:10:06.422Z\\\",\\\"archivedAt\\\":null,\\\"completedAt\\\":null,\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-07T10:10:06.397Z\\\",\\\"canceledAt\\\":null,\\\"dueDate\\\":null,\\\"slaStartedAt\\\":null,\\\"slaMediumRiskAt\\\":null,\\\"slaHighRiskAt\\\":null,\\\"slaBreachesAt\\\":null,\\\"status\\\":\\\"In Progress\\\",\\\"statusType\\\":\\\"started\\\",\\\"labels\\\":[\\\"web\\\",\\\"analytics\\\"],\\\"attachments\\\":[],\\\"documents\\\":[],\\\"stateHistory\\\":[{\\\"state\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"64be05ca-3288-4616-9b5b-4d0c8d805b56\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Backlog\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"backlog\\\"},\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-04T00:14:08.681Z\\\",\\\"endedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-07T10:10:06.422Z\\\"},{\\\"state\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"b878aab7-e95e-4f74-aac1-e8693ffd9fd1\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"In Progress\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"started\\\"},\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-07T10:10:06.422Z\\\",\\\"endedAt\\\":null}],\\\"createdBy\\\":\\\"Cooper Corbett\\\",\\\"createdById\\\":\\\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\\\",\\\"project\\\":\\\"Taxkit\\\",\\\"projectId\\\":\\\"4e0eb6ef-1871-46d4-8f47-9c8f52a9c069\\\",\\\"team\\\":\\\"Development\\\",\\\"teamId\\\":\\\"ed6b68f2-2ec2-4db2-983f-bdc5951dc79a\\\",\\\"relations\\\":{\\\"blocks\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-81\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T010 — Finish rebuild checks, package versioning and controlled delivery\\\"}],\\\"blockedBy\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-75\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T004 — Build all calculator pages and the fresh package interface\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-77\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T006 — Add remote MCP and visible browser calculator tools\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-76\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T005 — Rebuild docs, search discovery, public Markdown and share images\\\"}],\\\"relatedTo\\\":[],\\\"duplicateOf\\\":null}}\"}],\"isError\":false}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"939885\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000006042,\"exit_code\":1,\"original_token_count\":96,\"output\":\"{\\\"stage\\\": \\\"lint\\\", \\\"command\\\": [\\\"bun\\\", \\\"run\\\", \\\"lint\\\"], \\\"exitCode\\\": 0, \\\"durationSeconds\\\": 5.81, \\\"log\\\": \\\"/private/tmp/dev79-native-analytics-c-lint.log\\\"}\\n{\\\"stage\\\": \\\"native-build\\\", \\\"command\\\": [\\\"bun\\\", \\\"run\\\", \\\"web:build:native-pair\\\"], \\\"exitCode\\\": 1, \\\"durationSeconds\\\": 0.01, \\\"log\\\": \\\"/private/tmp/dev79-native-analytics-c-native-build.log\\\"}\\nerror: Script not found \\\"web:build:native-pair\\\"\\n\\n\"}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"32aa40\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000007167,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":830,\"output\":\"## Validate and hand off\\n\\nRun the repository's real format, lint, typecheck, focused tests, integration\\ntests, build, packed-artifact, and downstream commands that apply. Also run:\\n\\n```bash\\npython3 scripts/validate_package.py /absolute/package\\npython3 scripts/validate_ecosystem.py /absolute/skill-or-repository-root\\n```\\n\\nFor publishable packages, inspect the tarball produced by the repository's\\nactual publisher; `publishConfig.exports` alone is not proof that npm or Bun\\nremoved the development source condition.\\n\\nFor new or changed skill folders, run the global skill validator separately.\\nRun the local docs-maintainer checks and attach the applicable impact rows and\\nnon-claims. Report the selected variant, ownership decision, exports,\\ndocumentation/proof impact, tests, commands, and any repository-specific exception. Render receipts\\nretain official sources, qualified compatibility decisions, config digests,\\nlimitations, and non-claims. Read [maintenance](references/maintenance.md)\\nwhen updating templates, validators, or Effect APIs.\\n\\n## Strict data ownership in every package\\n\\nUse one Schema owner for each identity, constrained value and data record; infer\\napps/web/README.md:18:## What runs where\\napps/web/README.md:61:## Settings and generated owners\\napps/web/README.md:75:## Checks\\napps/web/README.md:142:## Related owners\\napps/web/README.md:215:## Calculator routes\\napps/web/README.md:297:## Native calculation rate admission\\napps/web/README.md:309:## Documentation pages\\napps/web/README.md:350:## Documentation search\\napps/web/README.md:387:## Documentation discovery\\napps/web/README.md:415:## Documentation Markdown\\napps/web/README.md:444:## Public documentation share images\\napps/web/README.md:478:## Release documentation check\\napps/web/README.md:503:## Visible calculator browser tools\\ndocs/architecture/frontend.md:17:## Scope\\ndocs/architecture/frontend.md:22:## Main areas\\ndocs/architecture/frontend.md:40:## Runtime shape\\ndocs/architecture/frontend.md:109:## Decoding and composition boundaries\\ndocs/architecture/frontend.md:137:## Visible composition and leaf ownership\\ndocs/architecture/frontend.md:183:## Guardrails\\ndocs/architecture/frontend.md:215:## Related Docs\\ndocs/architecture/frontend.md:307:## Page-owned browser tools\\ndocs/architecture/frontend.md:339:## Native calculation rate admission\\ndocs/architecture/frontend.md:350:## Replacement Website documentation composition\\ndocs/architecture/frontend.md:399:### Replacement Website search\\ndocs/architecture/frontend.md:423:### Replacement Website discovery files\\ndocs/architecture/frontend.md:444:### Replacement Website Markdown\\ndocs/architecture/frontend.md:467:### Replacement Website share metadata\\n{\\n  \\\"extends\\\": \\\"../../tsconfig.base.json\\\",\\n  \\\"compilerOptions\\\": {\\n    \\\"lib\\\": [\\\"ES2024\\\", \\\"DOM\\\", \\\"DOM.Iterable\\\"]\\n  },\\n  \\\"include\\\": [\\\"src/**/*.ts\\\", \\\"test/**/*.ts\\\", \\\"vitest.config.ts\\\"]\\n}\\n{\\n  \\\"extends\\\": \\\"./tsconfig.json\\\",\\n  \\\"compilerOptions\\\": {\\n    \\\"rootDir\\\": \\\"src\\\",\\n    \\\"outDir\\\": \\\"dist\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"include\\\": [\\\"src/**/*.ts\\\"],\\n  \\\"exclude\\\": [\\\"test\\\", \\\"vitest.config.ts\\\"]\\n}\\nimport { defaultServerConditions } from \\\"vite\\\";\\nimport { defineConfig } from \\\"vitest/config\\\";\\n\\nexport default defineConfig({\\n  resolve: { conditions: [\\\"source\\\", ...defaultServerConditions] },\\n  test: { fileParallelism: false, include: [\\\"test/**/*.test.ts\\\"] },\\n});\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a11571-1a58-7282-903b-860cd96057b2","create_time":1791370461.720963}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
