h}: {label}\")\nif failures:\n    print(\"\\n\".join(failures), file=sys.stderr)\n    raise SystemExit(1)\nprint(f\"ecosystem scan passed: {root}\")\n apps/api/README.md                                 | 35 ++++++++++++++++-\n apps/api/package.json                              |  2 +\n apps/api/src/mcp-session.layer.ts                  |  7 +++-\n apps/api/src/worker.application.ts                 | 13 ++++++-\n apps/api/src/worker.ts                             | 45 +++++++++++++++++++---\n apps/api/test/worker.boundary.test.ts              |  2 +-\n apps/web/package.json                              |  1 +\n apps/web/vitest.native.config.ts                   |  1 +\n bun.lock                                           | 20 ++++++++++\n docs/architecture/api-and-sdk.md                   |  7 ++++\n docs/architecture/effect-services.md               |  8 ++++\n docs/architecture/package-ownership.md             | 11 ++++++\n .../clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json              |  2 +-\n oxlint.config.ts                                   | 28 ++++++++++++++\n 14 files changed, 170 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)\n"},"started_at_ms":1791370470169,"completed_at_ms":1791370470169}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T10:54:32.060Z","ordinal":68790,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1055e-4560-7b33-82d2-226827c76159","turn_id":"01a11571-1a58-7282-903b-860cd96057b2","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-6a800696-3070-47da-829b-9506b20cad23","server":"codex_apps","tool":"linear.save_issue","arguments":{"id":"DEV-79","patch":[{"op":"replace","old_string":"finds the Cooper US organisation but no TaxKit project among its six accessible projects","new_string":"finds the Cooper organisation but no TaxKit project among its six accessible projects; the organisation's region and complete management listing still need verification"}]},"connectorId":"asdk_app_69a089a326dc8191b32a3f2553f5be2c","linkId":"link_6ac0779f5b188191860fcae4d4b097aa","appName":"Linear","actionName":"save_issue","readOnlyHint":false,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"DEV-79\",\"uuid\":\"85150329-9061-4690-8f80-bfbc7af57ebe\",\"title\":\"CSF-T008 — Track visits and calculator choice with minimal PostHog events\",\"description\":\"This issue tracks `CSF-T008` in the clean-slate rebuild plan.\\n\\nCooper wants traffic and calculator-use counts without sending the figures people enter or adding consent dialogs.\\n\\nWork to do:\\n\\n* Manage TaxKit Production and shared Preview PostHog projects through Alchemy with checked ownership and region.\\n* Send explicit pageviews from the website and one calculator_used event from the backend after a successful hosted calculation. Record which calculator was used, never its inputs or answer.\\n* Use a checked final field allowlist, memory-only browser identity and Do Not Track support. Disable automatic clicks, profiles, recordings and other unwanted capture; keep ordinary local/Preview capture off.\\n* Use the bounded same-origin event relay and owned Effect HTTP operations. Check the actual SDK transport, enrichment, retry identity and disposal so adapters do not count one action twice.\\n\\nAccept when:\\n\\n* Actual outbound payloads contain only approved page/usage fields, with no tax figures, free text or persistent browser identity.\\n* A successful calculation has one event owner; pure tax packages and local SDK use send no analytics.\\n* No consent dialog is introduced. Any provider event readback is proved separately in an approved Preview.\\n\\nRequired commands are recorded in the owning task: `bun run test`, `bun run test:oxlint`, `bun run check-types`, `bun run build`, `bun run check:docs`, `bun run check:runbooks`, `bun run verification`.\\n\\nDepends on `CSF-T004`, `CSF-T005`, `CSF-T006`. These will also be saved as native issue blockers.\\n\\nImplementation has started under Cooper’s approved continuation; the old whole-design hold is superseded. The prerequisite slices are locally accepted and delivered as reviewable drafts, including the deployed agent guide in <pull-request id=\\\"ebc88fb2-91a4-4b08-b8a7-503c330a40e5\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/review/dev-77-document-agent-setup-and-tested-cancellation-limits-4a0a6d3df773\\\">\\\\[DEV-77\\\\] Document agent setup and tested cancellation limits</pull-request> and checked deployment handover in <pull-request id=\\\"cf1c9900-6ac0-49aa-84a5-26d6fd1cff23\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/review/dev-78-align-native-deployment-handover-with-tested-local-operations-9525610e0f85\\\">DEV-78 align native deployment handover with tested local operations</pull-request>. Current PostHog browser SDK 1.438.2 and Distilled 1.0.0-rc.13 have been read from their official registry archives; installed Effect/Alchemy compatibility and actual transport still need local qualification. Read-only preparation finds the Cooper organisation but no TaxKit project among its six accessible projects; the organisation's region and complete management listing still need verification, and no PostHog configuration in taxkit/prd or taxkit/stg_preview. Prepare the private event rules, one backend successful-use owner, browser lifetime and bounded relay locally. Local/ordinary Preview capture stays disabled. New project setup, management credential and exact stored-event proof remain separate concrete provider operations; no provider or credential has been changed. Metrics remain deferred.\\n\\nOwning [task and checks](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json#L607>), [design](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md>) and [planning commit](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/commit/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b>).\",\"priority\":{\"value\":0,\"name\":\"No priority\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-79/csf-t008-track-visits-and-calculator-choice-with-minimal-posthog\",\"gitBranchName\":\"coopercorbett/dev-79-csf-t008-track-visits-and-calculator-choice-with-minimal\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-04T00:14:08.681Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-07T10:54:31.313Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-07T10:10:06.397Z\",\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"In Progress\",\"statusType\":\"started\",\"labels\":[\"web\",\"analytics\"],\"attachments\":[],\"documents\":[],\"createdBy\":\"Cooper Corbett\",\"createdById\":\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\",\"project\":\"Taxkit\",\"projectId\":\"4e0eb6ef-1871-46d4-8f47-9c8f52a9c069\",\"team\":\"Development\",\"teamId\":\"ed6b68f2-2ec2-4db2-983f-bdc5951dc79a\"}"}],"isError":false,"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"Linear MCP","title":"Linear","version":"1.0.0","websiteUrl":"https://linear.app","icons":[{"src":"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon.svg","mimeType":"image/svg+xml"}]}}},"duration":{"secs":1,"nanos":839758542}},"started_at_ms":1791370470219,"completed_at_ms":1791370472060}}
