lt native API returns tax results independently of rejected analytics\\nweb test:native-pair:  FAIL  test/native-analytics.boundary.test.ts > the built native API returns tax results independently of redirect analytics\\nweb test:native-pair:  FAIL  test/native-analytics.boundary.test.ts > the built native API returns tax results independently of stalled-reply analytics\\nweb test:native-pair: Error: [object Object]\\nweb test:native-pair:  ❯ ProxyServer.fetch ../../node_modules/.bun/miniflare@5.20261001.0-alpha+0c7a352d4ac2db91/node_modules/miniflare/src/workers/core/proxy.worker.ts:175:11\\nweb test:native-pair: \\nweb test:native-pair: ⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯[1/3]⎯\\nweb test:native-pair: \\nweb test:native-pair: \\nweb test:native-pair:  Test Files  1 failed (1)\\nweb test:native-pair:       Tests  3 failed (3)\\nweb test:native-pair:    Start at  21:54:49\\nweb test:native-pair:    Duration  1.65s (tests 71%, import 21%, transform 8%)\\nweb test:native-pair: \\nweb test:native-pair: Exited with code 1\\n\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a11571-1a58-7282-903b-860cd96057b2","create_time":1791370510.861035}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
