{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T11:36:10.379Z","ordinal":69526,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a11626-498b-7480-a15b-c65bf5e584af","call_id":"call_JJY8wGJQotrfzS9JyNrJV99v","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 2.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"i\":0,\"result\":{\"status\":\"fulfilled\",\"value\":{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"name: projects-get\\ntitle: Get projects\\ndescription: Fetches projects that the user has access to in the current organization.\\nannotations:\\n  destructiveHint: false\\n  idempotentHint: true\\n  openWorldHint: true\\n  readOnlyHint: true\\ninputSchema: '{\\\"$schema\\\":\\\"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"object\\\",\\\"properties\\\":{}}'\\n\"}],\"isError\":false}}}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"i\":1,\"result\":{\"status\":\"fulfilled\",\"value\":{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"{\\\"matches\\\":[],\\\"hint\\\":\\\"No tools matched \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"organization\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\". Run \\\\\\\"tools\\\\\\\" to see all available tool names.\\\"}\"}],\"isError\":false}}}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"i\":2,\"result\":{\"status\":\"fulfilled\",\"value\":{\"chunk_id\":\"58efff\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000006084,\"exit_code\":2,\"original_token_count\":502,\"output\":\"      Tests  16 passed (16)\\n   Start at  22:35:53\\n   Duration  599ms (tests 66%, import 26%, transform 6%, worker 1%)\\n\\n$ turbo run //#test:quality-workflow:task\\n\\n   • turbo 2.11.7\\n   • Packages in scope: //\\n   • Running //#test:quality-workflow:task in 1 package\\n   • Remote caching disabled, using shared worktree cache\\n\\n//:test:quality-workflow:task: cache miss, executing 775096340fbead63\\n//:test:quality-workflow:task: $ bun --bun vitest run --config tools/vitest.config.ts tools/quality-workflow\\n//:test:quality-workflow:task: \\n//:test:quality-workflow:task:  RUN  v5.0.3 /Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit\\n//:test:quality-workflow:task: \\n1077:   * if you are calling this from client code, you're probably looking for `posthog.capture('$custom_event', {...})`\\n1548:   * answer, sees the confirmation, and `capture()` drops the `survey sent` event. So\\n1550:   * `capture()` uses, so cookieless `on_reject` stays eligible.\\n2980:  capture(event: string, properties?: Properties | null, options?: CaptureOptions$1): void;\\n3046:  _requestQueue?: RequestQueue;\\n3047:  _retryQueue?: RetryQueue;\\n3171:  _send_request(options: QueuedRequestWithOptions): void;\\n3172:  _send_retriable_request(options: QueuedRequestWithOptions, transportOverride?: QueuedRequestWithOptions['transport']): void;\\n3218:   * posthog.capture('cta-button-clicked', {\\n3234:  capture(event_name: EventName, properties?: Properties | null, options?: CaptureOptions): CaptureResult | undefined;\\n4075:   * `capture()` call, you can remove properties with a dedicated method.\\n4648:   * posthog.startExceptionAutocapture()\\n4654:   * posthog.startExceptionAutocapture({\\n4664:  startExceptionAutocapture(config?: ExceptionAutoCaptureConfig): void;\\n4675:   * posthog.stopExceptionAutocapture()\\n4678:  stopExceptionAutocapture(): void;\\nrg: apps/web/src/lib/service.ts: No such file or directory (os error 2)\\npackages/infrastructure/src/apps-stack.ts:29:// A forward API tag registers before its implementation Layer finishes. The\\n\"}}}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a11571-1a58-7282-903b-860cd96057b2","create_time":1791372970.379793}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
