{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T11:38:32.949Z","ordinal":69554,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1055e-4560-7b33-82d2-226827c76159","turn_id":"01a11571-1a58-7282-903b-860cd96057b2","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_02692a5b008ee3bd016ac62f358d4087d097b249bcf3fea013","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The real browser test sent both a waiting event and a retry after Do Not Track switched on. I’ve prepared a [small sender proposal](/private/tmp/dev79-browser-sender-proposal.md) that keeps the same approved data and PostHog destination.\n\nThe [browser adapter guide](/Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit/.agents/skills/effect-client-wrapper/references/posthog-browser.md) says, “If the supported SDK cannot meet the required policy, surface that mismatch rather than bypassing its queue contract.” Replacing the library changes the agreed design, so that choice needs your approval. I’m continuing the independent checks and provider preparation.\n"}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1791373109568,"completed_at_ms":1791373112949}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T11:38:32.950Z","ordinal":69555,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_02692a5b008ee3bd016ac62f358d4087d097b249bcf3fea013","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"The real browser test sent both a waiting event and a retry after Do Not Track switched on. I’ve prepared a [small sender proposal](/private/tmp/dev79-browser-sender-proposal.md) that keeps the same approved data and PostHog destination.\n\nThe [browser adapter guide](/Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit/.agents/skills/effect-client-wrapper/references/posthog-browser.md) says, “If the supported SDK cannot meet the required policy, surface that mismatch rather than bypassing its queue contract.” Replacing the library changes the agreed design, so that choice needs your approval. I’m continuing the independent checks and provider preparation.\n"}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a11571-1a58-7282-903b-860cd96057b2","create_time":1791373109.5575478,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_02692a5b008ee3bd016ac62f358d4087d097b249bcf3fea013","turn_id":"01a11571-1a58-7282-903b-860cd96057b2","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a11628-7676-7541-9fe8-ed66dd1186da","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":1460}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T11:38:36.057Z","ordinal":69556,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_02692a5b008ee3bd016ac62f38ee9c87d0a669454b213346b3","name":"request_user_input_async","arguments":"{\"questions\":[{\"title\":\"Approve the browser sender change described in /private/tmp/dev79-browser-sender-proposal.md? TaxKit’s small sender would keep the same approved pageview fields and PostHog projects, while allowing waiting sends to stop when Do Not Track turns on. Keeping the current library leaves browser activation unfinished because its supported API cannot discard those waiting events.\",\"options\":[\"Use the small TaxKit sender (Recommended)\",\"Keep the PostHog browser library\"]}]}","call_id":"call_a2bb26d5864443359dc39f4d3ff35630","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a11571-1a58-7282-903b-860cd96057b2","create_time":1791373112.9361336}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":1461}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T11:38:36.058Z","ordinal":69557,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1055e-4560-7b33-82d2-226827c76159","turn_id":"01a11571-1a58-7282-903b-860cd96057b2","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"call_a2bb26d5864443359dc39f4d3ff35630","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Approve the browser sender change described in /private/tmp/dev79-browser-sender-proposal.md? TaxKit’s small sender would keep the same approved pageview fields and PostHog projects, while allowing waiting sends to stop when Do Not Track turns on. Keeping the current library leaves browser activation unfinished because its supported API cannot discard those waiting events.\n- Use the small TaxKit sender (Recommended)\n- Keep the PostHog browser library"}],"phase":"final_answer","delivery":"async","questions":[{"title":"Approve the browser sender change described in /private/tmp/dev79-browser-sender-proposal.md? TaxKit’s small sender would keep the same approved pageview fields and PostHog projects, while allowing waiting sends to stop when Do Not Track turns on. Keeping the current library leaves browser activation unfinished because its supported API cannot discard those waiting events.","options":["Use the small TaxKit sender (Recommended)","Keep the PostHog browser library"]}]},"started_at_ms":1791373116058,"completed_at_ms":1791373116058}}
