{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T11:45:05.444Z","ordinal":69647,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1055e-4560-7b33-82d2-226827c76159","turn_id":"01a11571-1a58-7282-903b-860cd96057b2","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-6156764a-b0c0-4ff2-8755-0d745290b947","server":"codex_apps","tool":"posthog.exec","arguments":{"command":"call docs-search {\"query\":\"What are the Required API key scopes for POST /api/organizations/:organization_id/projects/, PATCH /api/organizations/:organization_id/projects/:id/, GET projects listing and POST /api/projects/:project_id/query/?\"}","context":"Read-only TaxKit management plan; identify exact endpoint permissions. No provider, credential, billing or other changes.","conversation_id":"01a115c6-eb76-7c60-b844-89c2daa3e68a","llm_model":"gpt-6"},"connectorId":"asdk_app_699caef2d680819188727b0ddbb349dd","linkId":"link_6a2e191ad8c88191b46d4bc2f680d113","appName":"PostHog","actionName":"exec","readOnlyHint":false,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"content: \"Found 2 relevant documentation page(s):\\n\\n# Projects API Reference - PostHog\\nURL: https://posthog.com/docs/api/projects\\n\\n# Projects\\n\\n> For instructions on how to authenticate to use this endpoint, see [API overview](https://posthog.com/docs/api/overview) .\\n> \\n> \\n\\n ### Endpoints\\n\\n|  |  |\\n| --- | --- |\\n| `GET` | `/api/organizations/:organization_id/projects/` |\\n| `POST` | `/api/organizations/:organization_id/projects/` |\\n| `GET` | `/api/organizations/:organization_id/projects/:id/` |\\n| `PATCH` | `/api/organizations/:organization_id/projects/:id/` |\\n| `DELETE` | `/api/organizations/:organization_id/projects/:id/` |\\n| `GET` | `/api/organizations/:organization_id/projects/:id/access_control_default_objects/` |\\n| `GET` | `/api/organizations/:organization_id/projects/:id/access_control_default_properties/` |\\n| `GET` | `/api/organizations/:organization_id/projects/:id/access_control_defaults/` |\\n| `GET` | `/api/organizations/:organization_id/projects/:id/access_control_member_objects/` |\\n| `GET` | `/api/organizations/:organization_id/projects/:id/access_control_member_properties/` |\\n| `GET` | `/api/organizations/:organization_id/projects/:id/access_control_members/` |\\n| `GET` | `/api/organizations/:organization_id/projects/:id/access_control_role_objects/` |\\n| `GET` | `/api/organizations/:organization_id/projects/:id/access_control_role_properties/` |\\n| `GET` | `/api/organizations/:organization_id/projects/:id/access_control_roles/` |\\n| `GET` | `/api/organizations/:organization_id/projects/:id/activity/` |\\n| `PATCH` | `/api/organizations/:organization_id/projects/:id/add_product_intent/` |\\n| `POST` | `/api/organizations/:organization_id/projects/:id/cancel-deletion/` |\\n| `POST` | `/api/organizations/:organization_id/projects/:id/change_organization/` |\\n| `PATCH` | `/api/organizations/:organization_id/projects/:id/complete_product_onboarding/` |\\n\\n [Next page →](https://posthog.com/docs/api/projects-2) ##  List all organizations projects\\n\\n Projects for the current organization.\\n\\n #### Required API key scopes\\n\\n\\n---\\n\\n# file_system (and other) scopes missing from personal API key UI\\nURL: https://github.com/PostHog/posthog/issues/57977\\n\\n\\n  Suggested fix\\n\\n  Either (a) generate the frontend API_SCOPES list from the backend APIScopeObject definition so they cannot drift, or (b) add the missing scopes manually and add a CI check that diffs the two lists.\\n\\n\\n### Debug info\\n\\n```shell\\n- [X] PostHog Cloud, Debug information: Session: https://us.posthog.com/project/sTMFPsFhdP1Ssg/replay/019e0296-0d2a-72f1-a2ee-0c94b79cbf82?t=355\\nAdmin: http://go/adminOrgEU/019763b5-4715-0000-2244-e95c0efb490f (project ID 74603)\\n```\\n\\n\""}],"isError":false,"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"PostHog","version":"1.0.0"}}},"duration":{"secs":6,"nanos":350964459}},"started_at_ms":1791373499092,"completed_at_ms":1791373505443}}
