ization_id/projects/:id/access_control_defaults/` |\\n| `GET` | `/api/organizations/:organization_id/projects/:id/access_control_member_objects/` |\\n| `GET` | `/api/organizations/:organization_id/projects/:id/access_control_member_properties/` |\\n| `GET` | `/api/organizations/:organization_id/projects/:id/access_control_members/` |\\n| `GET` | `/api/organizations/:organization_id/projects/:id/access_control_role_objects/` |\\n| `GET` | `/api/organizations/:organization_id/projects/:id/access_control_role_properties/` |\\n| `GET` | `/api/organizations/:organization_id/projects/:id/access_control_roles/` |\\n| `GET` | `/api/organizations/:organization_id/projects/:id/activity/` |\\n| `PATCH` | `/api/organizations/:organization_id/projects/:id/add_product_intent/` |\\n| `POST` | `/api/organizations/:organization_id/projects/:id/cancel-deletion/` |\\n| `POST` | `/api/organizations/:organization_id/projects/:id/change_organization/` |\\n| `PATCH` | `/api/organizations/:organization_id/projects/:id/complete_product_onboarding/` |\\n\\n [Next page →](https://posthog.com/docs/api/projects-2) ##  List all organizations projects\\n\\n Projects for the current organization.\\n\\n #### Required API key scopes\\n\\n\\n---\\n\\n# file_system (and other) scopes missing from personal API key UI\\nURL: https://github.com/PostHog/posthog/issues/57977\\n\\n\\n  Suggested fix\\n\\n  Either (a) generate the frontend API_SCOPES list from the backend APIScopeObject definition so they cannot drift, or (b) add the missing scopes manually and add a CI check that diffs the two lists.\\n\\n\\n### Debug info\\n\\n```shell\\n- [X] PostHog Cloud, Debug information: Session: https://us.posthog.com/project/sTMFPsFhdP1Ssg/replay/019e0296-0d2a-72f1-a2ee-0c94b79cbf82?t=355\\nAdmin: http://go/adminOrgEU/019763b5-4715-0000-2244-e95c0efb490f (project ID 74603)\\n```\\n\\n\""}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a11571-1a58-7282-903b-860cd96057b2","create_time":1791373505.515768}