use send no analytics.\\\\n* No consent dialog is introduced. Any provider event readback is proved separately in an approved Preview.\\\\n\\\\nRequired commands are recorded in the owning task: `bun run test`, `bun run test:oxlint`, `bun run check-types`, `bun run build`, `bun run check:docs`, `bun run check:runbooks`, `bun run verification`.\\\\n\\\\nDepends on `CSF-T004`, `CSF-T005`, `CSF-T006`. These will also be saved as native issue blockers.\\\\n\\\\nImplementation has started under Cooper’s approved continuation; the old whole-design hold is superseded. The prerequisite slices are locally accepted and delivered as reviewable drafts, including the deployed agent guide in <pull-request id=\\\\\\\"ebc88fb2-91a4-4b08-b8a7-503c330a40e5\\\\\\\" href=\\\\\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/review/dev-77-document-agent-setup-and-tested-cancellation-limits-4a0a6d3df773\\\\\\\">\\\\\\\\[DEV-77\\\\\\\\] Document agent setup and tested cancellation limits</pull-request> and checked deployment handover in <pull-request id=\\\\\\\"cf1c9900-6ac0-49aa-84a5-26d6fd1cff23\\\\\\\" href=\\\\\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/review/dev-78-align-native-deployment-handover-with-tested-local-operations-9525610e0f85\\\\\\\">DEV-78 align native deployment handover with tested local operations</pull-request>. Current PostHog browser SDK 1.438.2 and Distilled 1.0.0-rc.13 have been read from their official registry archives; installed Effect/Alchemy compatibility and actual transport still need local qualification. Read-only preparation finds the Cooper organisation but no TaxKit project among its six accessible projects; the organisation's region and complete management listing still need verification, and no PostHog configuration in taxkit/prd or taxkit/stg_preview. Prepare the private event rules, one backend successful-use owner, browser lifetime and bounded relay locally. Local/ordinary Preview capture stays disabled. New project setup, management credential and exact stored-event proof remain separate concrete provider operations; no provider or credential has been changed. Metrics remain deferred.\\\\n\\\\nOwning [task and checks](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json#L607>), [design](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md>) and [planning commit](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/commit/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b>).\\\",\\\"priority\\\":{\\\"value\\\":0,\\\"name\\\":\\\"No priority\\\"},\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-79/csf-t008-track-visits-and-calculator-choice-with-minimal-posthog\\\",\\\"gitBranchName\\\":\\\"coopercorbett/dev-79-csf-t008-track-visits-and-calculator-choice-with-minimal\\\",\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-04T00:14:08.681Z\\\",\\\"updatedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-07T10:54:31.313Z\\\",\\\"archivedAt\\\":null,\\\"completedAt\\\":null,\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-07T10:10:06.397Z\\\",\\\"canceledAt\\\":null,\\\"dueDate\\\":null,\\\"slaStartedAt\\\":null,\\\"slaMediumRiskAt\\\":null,\\\"slaHighRiskAt\\\":null,\\\"slaBreachesAt\\\":null,\\\"status\\\":\\\"In Progress\\\",\\\"statusType\\\":\\\"started\\\",\\\"labels\\\":[\\\"web\\\",\\\"analytics\\\"],\\\"attachments\\\":[],\\\"documents\\\":[],\\\"stateHistory\\\":[{\\\"state\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"64be05ca-3288-4616-9b5b-4d0c8d805b56\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Backlog\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"backlog\\\"},\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-04T00:14:08.681Z\\\",\\\"endedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-07T10:10:06.422Z\\\"},{\\\"state\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"b878aab7-e95e-4f74-aac1-e8693ffd9fd1\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"In Progress\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"started\\\"},\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-07T10:10:06.422Z\\\",\\\"endedAt\\\":null}],\\\"createdBy\\\":\\\"Cooper Corbett\\\",\\\"createdById\\\":\\\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\\\",\\\"project\\\":\\\"Taxkit\\\",\\\"projectI