ndependent\\nprovider and backend work; do not bypass private SDK queues or infer approval\\nfrom elapsed time. The connector produces a US-host UI link, but authenticated\\nmanagement ownership, complete listing and capacity are still unverified. All\\nfour TaxKit Doppler configs (`ci`, `dev`, `prd`, `stg_preview`) have no PostHog\\nvariable names. No provider or credential has changed; metrics remain deferred.\\n';p.write_text(s)\nprint(json.dumps({'fullyVerifiedSource':q['candidateCommit'],'trackedMatched':1772,'betweenSourceChanges':changes,'wholeVerificationSeconds':q['checks'][0]['durationSeconds']}))\nPY\npython3 /private/tmp/dev75-request-run-checks.py '[[\"docs\",[\"bun\",\"run\",\"check:docs\"]],[\"runbooks\",[\"bun\",\"run\",\"check:runbooks\"]],[\"paths\",[\"bun\",\"run\",\"check:repository-paths\"]],[\"format\",[\"bun\",\"run\",\"format:check\"]],[\"diff\",[\"git\",\"diff\",\"--check\"]]]' dev79-backend-close-a"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","stdout":"{\"candidate\": \"311288c3b12c768af15e1efe4738286b56b5e506\", \"frozenFiles\": 1772, \"exitCode\": 0, \"durationSeconds\": {\"verification\": 680.92}, \"qualification\": \"/private/tmp/dev79-backend-local-qualification.json\"}\n{\"fullyVerifiedSource\": \"311288c3b12c768af15e1efe4738286b56b5e506\", \"trackedMatched\": 1772, \"betweenSourceChanges\": [\"apps/web/test/native-local-development.boundary.test.ts\", \"docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-analytics-backend-and-request-policy.json\", \"docs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md\"], \"wholeVerificationSeconds\": 680.92}\n{\"stage\": \"docs\", \"command\": [\"bun\", \"run\", \"check:docs\"], \"exitCode\": 0, \"durationSeconds\": 0.34, \"log\": \"/private/tmp/dev79-backend-close-a-docs.log\"}\n{\"stage\": \"runbooks\", \"command\": [\"bun\", \"run\", \"check:runbooks\"], \"exitCode\": 0, \"durationSeconds\": 0.14, \"log\": \"/private/tmp/dev79-backend-close-a-runbooks.log\"}\n{\"stage\": \"paths\",