tions/SKILL.md)\n- install-anti-slop: Install and  (file: r1/install-anti-slop/SKILL.md)\n- local-transcribe: Transcribe (file: r0/local-transcribe/SKILL.md)\n- marketing-pages: Design and  (file: r1/ai-for-ui-skills/marketing-pages/SKILL.md)\n- mobius-executor-ingestion: Use when a u (file: r0/mobius-executor-ingestion/SKILL.md)\n- motion-brief: Interview  (file: r1/ai-for-animation-skills/motion-brief/SKILL.md)\n- motion-react: Build anim (file: r1/ai-for-animation-skills/motion-react/SKILL.md)\n- openai-developers:agents: Build agent (file: r11/agents/SKILL.md)\n- openai-developers:devday-guide: Help with O (file: r11/devday-guide/SKILL.md)\n- openai-developers:openai-api-troubleshooting: Use when an (file: r11/openai-api-troubleshooting/SKILL.md)\n- openai-developers:openai-platform-api-key: Use when Code (file: r11/openai-platform-api-key/SKILL.md)\n- pages:maintain-space: Reconcile n (file: r12/maintain-space/SKILL.md)\n- pages:manage-schedules: Review a Ch (file: r12/manage-schedules/SKILL.md)\n- pages:organize-space: Organize ex (file: r12/organize-space/SKILL.md)\n- pages:write-page: Create or e (file: r12/write-page/SKILL.md)\n- parallel-data-enrichment: Bulk data  (file: r1/parallel-data-enrichment/SKILL.md)\n- parallel-deep-research: ONLY use w (file: r1/parallel-deep-research/SKILL.md)\n- parallel-web-extract: URL conten (file: r1/parallel-web-extract/SKILL.md)\n- parallel-web-search: DEFAULT for  (file: r1/parallel-web-search/SKILL.md)\n- pascal-agent-skills:furniture-fit: Assess whet (file: r18/furniture-fit/SKILL.md)\n- pascal-agent-skills:pascal-3d: Connect to  (file: r18/pascal-3d/SKILL.md)\n- pdf: Use when tas (file: r0/pdf/SKILL.md)\n- pdf:pdf: Read, creat (file: r16/pdf/26.921.10847/skills/pdf/SKILL.md)\n- performance: Rules for m (file: r1/ai-for-ui-skills/performance/SKILL.md)\n- pick-ui-library: Picks the to (file: r1/ai-for-animation-skills/pick-ui-library/SKILL.md)\n- playwriter: Control th (file: r0/playwriter/SKILL.md)\n- plugin-managemen