{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T11:55:06.664Z","ordinal":69762,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1055e-4560-7b33-82d2-226827c76159","turn_id":"01a11571-1a58-7282-903b-860cd96057b2","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-319b5210-21d3-480e-826e-c60ad5012040","server":"codex_apps","tool":"linear.get_issue","arguments":{"id":"DEV-79","includeRelations":true},"connectorId":"asdk_app_69a089a326dc8191b32a3f2553f5be2c","linkId":"link_6ac0779f5b188191860fcae4d4b097aa","appName":"Linear","actionName":"get_issue","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"DEV-79\",\"uuid\":\"85150329-9061-4690-8f80-bfbc7af57ebe\",\"title\":\"CSF-T008 — Track visits and calculator choice with minimal PostHog events\",\"description\":\"This issue tracks `CSF-T008` in the clean-slate rebuild plan.\\n\\nCooper wants traffic and calculator-use counts without sending the figures people enter or adding consent dialogs.\\n\\nWork to do:\\n\\n* Manage TaxKit Production and shared Preview PostHog projects through Alchemy with checked ownership and region.\\n* Send explicit pageviews from the website and one calculator_used event from the backend after a successful hosted calculation. Record which calculator was used, never its inputs or answer.\\n* Use a checked final field allowlist, memory-only browser identity and Do Not Track support. Disable automatic clicks, profiles, recordings and other unwanted capture; keep ordinary local/Preview capture off.\\n* Use the bounded same-origin event relay and owned Effect HTTP operations. Check the actual SDK transport, enrichment, retry identity and disposal so adapters do not count one action twice.\\n\\nAccept when:\\n\\n* Actual outbound payloads contain only approved page/usage fields, with no tax figures, free text or persistent browser identity.\\n* A successful calculation has one event owner; pure tax packages and local SDK use send no analytics.\\n* No consent dialog is introduced. Any provider event readback is proved separately in an approved Preview.\\n\\nRequired commands are recorded in the owning task: `bun run test`, `bun run test:oxlint`, `bun run check-types`, `bun run build`, `bun run check:docs`, `bun run check:runbooks`, `bun run verification`.\\n\\nDepends on `CSF-T004`, `CSF-T005`, `CSF-T006`. These will also be saved as native issue blockers.\\n\\nImplementation has started under Cooper’s approved continuation; the old whole-design hold is superseded. Draft <pull-request id=\\\"2b511c97-dbfb-4467-8135-c389d7e481b5\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/review/dev-79-add-minimal-calculator-events-and-per-request-opt-out-4dbb2d55a3aa\\\">crcorbett/taxkit#164</pull-request>, stacked on the checked deployment handover in draft <pull-request id=\\\"cf1c9900-6ac0-49aa-84a5-26d6fd1cff23\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/review/dev-78-align-native-deployment-handover-with-tested-local-operations-9525610e0f85\\\">crcorbett/taxkit#163</pull-request>, contains the private calculator event rules and one successful-use owner shared by HTTP, RPC and both supported remote MCP protocols. It records catalogue ID and name only; inputs, answers and request details are excluded. Collection is off by default, and fresh request policy honours denial, malformed headers and Do Not Track without changing the calculation answer. Local root tests and builds passed on 73f2bc7; full verification passed on 311288c in 680.92 seconds, including all 17 built native cases. The final documentation-only changes passed focused checks with all 1,770 other frozen identities unchanged. See the [qualification receipt](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/bea4539137e14844dff3732691c856a19353f626/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-analytics-backend-and-request-policy.json>). Browser collection remains unfinished: controlled tests of PostHog SDK 1.438.2 prove waiting and retried events can still send after Do Not Track turns on, and its supported public API cannot discard them. A concrete small TaxKit sender proposal is awaiting Cooper’s decision before changing the accepted browser design. The bounded browser relay, Website opt-out forwarding, retained project definitions, private credentials, exact stored-event proof and public privacy/operations updates remain to do. Read-only provider preparation finds the Cooper organisation but no TaxKit project among six accessible projects; region and complete management listing still need verification. Local/ordinary Preview capture stays disabled. No PostHog project, credential or analytics deployment has changed. Metrics remain deferred.\\n\\nOwning [task and checks](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json#L607>), [design](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md>) and [planning commit](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/commit/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b>).\",\"priority\":{\"value\":0,\"name\":\"No priority\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-79/csf-t008-track-visits-and-calculator-choice-with-minimal-posthog\",\"gitBranchName\":\"coopercorbett/dev-79-csf-t008-track-visits-and-calculator-choice-with-minimal\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-04T00:14:08.681Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-07T11:54:47.127Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-07T10:10:06.397Z\",\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"In Progress\",\"statusType\":\"started\",\"labels\":[\"web\",\"analytics\"],\"attachments\":[{\"id\":\"76b5361d-7b4f-43c7-99cf-dae53c587d08\",\"title\":\"DEV-79: Add minimal calculator events and per-request opt-out\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/164\"}],\"documents\":[],\"stateHistory\":[{\"state\":{\"id\":\"64be05ca-3288-4616-9b5b-4d0c8d805b56\",\"name\":\"Backlog\",\"type\":\"backlog\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-04T00:14:08.681Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-10-07T10:10:06.422Z\"},{\"state\":{\"id\":\"b878aab7-e95e-4f74-aac1-e8693ffd9fd1\",\"name\":\"In Progress\",\"type\":\"started\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-07T10:10:06.422Z\",\"endedAt\":null}],\"createdBy\":\"Cooper Corbett\",\"createdById\":\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\",\"assignee\":\"Cooper Corbett\",\"assigneeId\":\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\",\"project\":\"Taxkit\",\"projectId\":\"4e0eb6ef-1871-46d4-8f47-9c8f52a9c069\",\"team\":\"Development\",\"teamId\":\"ed6b68f2-2ec2-4db2-983f-bdc5951dc79a\",\"relations\":{\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"DEV-81\",\"title\":\"CSF-T010 — Finish rebuild checks, package versioning and controlled delivery\"}],\"blockedBy\":[{\"id\":\"DEV-75\",\"title\":\"CSF-T004 — Build all calculator pages and the fresh package interface\"},{\"id\":\"DEV-77\",\"title\":\"CSF-T006 — Add remote MCP and visible browser calculator tools\"},{\"id\":\"DEV-76\",\"title\":\"CSF-T005 — Rebuild docs, search discovery, public Markdown and share images\"}],\"relatedTo\":[],\"duplicateOf\":null}}"}],"isError":false,"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"Linear MCP","title":"Linear","version":"1.0.0","websiteUrl":"https://linear.app","icons":[{"src":"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon.svg","mimeType":"image/svg+xml"}]}}},"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":556292209}},"started_at_ms":1791374106105,"completed_at_ms":1791374106664}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T11:55:07.089Z","ordinal":69763,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1055e-4560-7b33-82d2-226827c76159","turn_id":"01a11571-1a58-7282-903b-860cd96057b2","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-6a8ac9bd-192b-4e08-9faf-bba367e7eb20","server":"codex_apps","tool":"linear.list_comments","arguments":{"issueId":"85150329-9061-4690-8f80-bfbc7af57ebe","limit":100,"orderBy":"createdAt"},"connectorId":"asdk_app_69a089a326dc8191b32a3f2553f5be2c","linkId":"link_6ac0779f5b188191860fcae4d4b097aa","appName":"Linear","actionName":"list_comments","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"comments\":[{\"id\":\"01822689-2dc4-401f-b8bb-049df8ce1cdc\",\"body\":\"Draft [#164](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/164) is ready for review of the calculator event code. Successful hosted calculations collect only the catalogue ID and name, with one shared owner for HTTP, RPC and both supported remote MCP protocols. Tax inputs and answers are excluded; denial and Do Not Track leave calculations unchanged.\\n\\nLocal root tests and builds passed on [73f2bc7](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/commit/73f2bc7d8bcdb49446e02e878a3944e7e263e8c8). Full `bun run verification` passed on [311288c](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/commit/311288c3b12c768af15e1efe4738286b56b5e506) in 680.92 seconds, including all 17 built native cases. The earlier reload fixture failure and its correction are retained in the [receipt](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/bea4539137e14844dff3732691c856a19353f626/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-analytics-backend-and-request-policy.json). Final documentation-only checks passed and all 1,770 other frozen identities matched. Checks ran locally because GitHub Actions credits are exhausted.\\n\\nDEV-79 remains In Progress. Controlled browser tests found that PostHog SDK 1.438.2 can send waiting and retried events after Do Not Track turns on. Cooper’s concrete sender choice is pending; independent relay and provider preparation can continue. Browser collection, Website opt-out forwarding, retained project setup, scoped credentials, stored-event proof and privacy/operations documentation remain unfinished. Local development and ordinary Preview collection stay off. No PostHog provider or credential change, analytics deployment, merge or publication has happened. Metrics remain deferred.\",\"attachments\":[],\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-07T11:55:05.613Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-07T11:55:05.576Z\",\"parentId\":null,\"resolvedAt\":null,\"quotedText\":null,\"author\":{\"id\":\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\",\"name\":\"Cooper Corbett\"},\"onBehalfOf\":null}],\"hasNextPage\":false}"}],"isError":false,"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"Linear MCP","title":"Linear","version":"1.0.0","websiteUrl":"https://linear.app","icons":[{"src":"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon.svg","mimeType":"image/svg+xml"}]}}},"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":981050625}},"started_at_ms":1791374106107,"completed_at_ms":1791374107089}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T11:55:07.159Z","ordinal":69764,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a11637-a217-7710-84ef-62859ceafe88","call_id":"call_ae334fe892d848adaf318eee6d6d7cd0","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 2.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"01822689-2dc4-401f-b8bb-049df8ce1cdc\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"Draft [#164](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/164) is ready for review of the calculator event code. Successful hosted calculations collect only the catalogue ID and name, with one shared owner for HTTP, RPC and both supported remote MCP protocols. Tax inputs and answers are excluded; denial and Do Not Track leave calculations unchanged.\\\\n\\\\nLocal root tests and builds passed on [73f2bc7](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/commit/73f2bc7d8bcdb49446e02e878a3944e7e263e8c8). Full `bun run verification` passed on [311288c](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/commit/311288c3b12c768af15e1efe4738286b56b5e506) in 680.92 seconds, including all 17 built native cases. The earlier reload fixture failure and its correction are retained in the [receipt](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/bea4539137e14844dff3732691c856a19353f626/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-analytics-backend-and-request-policy.json). Final documentation-only checks passed and all 1,770 other frozen identities matched. Checks ran locally because GitHub Actions credits are exhausted.\\\\n\\\\nDEV-79 remains In Progress. Controlled browser tests found that PostHog SDK 1.438.2 can send waiting and retried events after Do Not Track turns on. Cooper’s concrete sender choice is pending; independent relay and provider preparation can continue. Browser collection, Website opt-out forwarding, retained project setup, scoped credentials, stored-event proof and privacy/operations documentation remain unfinished. Local development and ordinary Preview collection stay off. No PostHog provider or credential change, analytics deployment, merge or publication has happened. Metrics remain deferred.\\\",\\\"attachments\\\":[],\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-07T11:55:05.613Z\\\",\\\"updatedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-07T11:55:05.576Z\\\",\\\"parentId\\\":null,\\\"resolvedAt\\\":null,\\\"quotedText\\\":null,\\\"author\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Cooper Corbett\\\"},\\\"onBehalfOf\\\":null}\"}],\"isError\":false}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"i\":0,\"status\":\"fulfilled\",\"value\":{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-79\\\",\\\"uuid\\\":\\\"85150329-9061-4690-8f80-bfbc7af57ebe\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T008 — Track visits and calculator choice with minimal PostHog events\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"This issue tracks `CSF-T008` in the clean-slate rebuild plan.\\\\n\\\\nCooper wants traffic and calculator-use counts without sending the figures people enter or adding consent dialogs.\\\\n\\\\nWork to do:\\\\n\\\\n* Manage TaxKit Production and shared Preview PostHog projects through Alchemy with checked ownership and region.\\\\n* Send explicit pageviews from the website and one calculator_used event from the backend after a successful hosted calculation. Record which calculator was used, never its inputs or answer.\\\\n* Use a checked final field allowlist, memory-only browser identity and Do Not Track support. Disable automatic clicks, profiles, recordings and other unwanted capture; keep ordinary local/Preview capture off.\\\\n* Use the bounded same-origin event relay and owned Effect HTTP operations. Check the actual SDK transport, enrichment, retry identity and disposal so adapters do not count one action twice.\\\\n\\\\nAccept when:\\\\n\\\\n* Actual outbound payloads contain only approved page/usage fields, with no tax figures, free text or persistent browser identity.\\\\n* A successful calculation has one event owner; pure tax packages and local SDK use send no analytics.\\\\n* No consent dialog is introduced. Any provider event readback is proved separately in an approved Preview.\\\\n\\\\nRequired commands are recorded in the owning task: `bun run test`, `bun run test:oxlint`, `bun run check-types`, `bun run build`, `bun run check:docs`, `bun run check:runbooks`, `bun run verification`.\\\\n\\\\nDepends on `CSF-T004`, `CSF-T005`, `CSF-T006`. These will also be saved as native issue blockers.\\\\n\\\\nImplementation has started under Cooper’s approved continuation; the old whole-design hold is superseded. Draft <pull-request id=\\\\\\\"2b511c97-dbfb-4467-8135-c389d7e481b5\\\\\\\" href=\\\\\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/review/dev-79-add-minimal-calculator-events-and-per-request-opt-out-4dbb2d55a3aa\\\\\\\">crcorbett/taxkit#164</pull-request>, stacked on the checked deployment handover in draft <pull-request id=\\\\\\\"cf1c9900-6ac0-49aa-84a5-26d6fd1cff23\\\\\\\" href=\\\\\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/review/dev-78-align-native-deployment-handover-with-tested-local-operations-9525610e0f85\\\\\\\">crcorbett/taxkit#163</pull-request>, contains the private calculator event rules and one successful-use owner shared by HTTP, RPC and both supported remote MCP protocols. It records catalogue ID and name only; inputs, answers and request details are excluded. Collection is off by default, and fresh request policy honours denial, malformed headers and Do Not Track without changing the calculation answer. Local root tests and builds passed on 73f2bc7; full verification passed on 311288c in 680.92 seconds, including all 17 built native cases. The final documentation-only changes passed focused checks with all 1,770 other frozen identities unchanged. See the [qualification receipt](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/bea4539137e14844dff3732691c856a19353f626/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-analytics-backend-and-request-policy.json>). Browser collection remains unfinished: controlled tests of PostHog SDK 1.438.2 prove waiting and retried events can still send after Do Not Track turns on, and its supported public API cannot discard them. A concrete small TaxKit sender proposal is awaiting Cooper’s decision before changing the accepted browser design. The bounded browser relay, Website opt-out forwarding, retained project definitions, private credentials, exact stored-event proof and public privacy/operations updates remain to do. Read-only provider preparation finds the Cooper organisation but no TaxKit project among six accessible projects; region and complete management listing still need verification. Local/ordinary Preview capture stays disabled. No PostHog project, credential or analytics deployment has changed. Metrics remain deferred.\\\\n\\\\nOwning [task and checks](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json#L607>), [design](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md>) and [planning commit](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/commit/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b>).\\\",\\\"priority\\\":{\\\"value\\\":0,\\\"name\\\":\\\"No priority\\\"},\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-79/csf-t008-track-visits-and-calculator-choice-with-minimal-posthog\\\",\\\"gitBranchName\\\":\\\"coopercorbett/dev-79-csf-t008-track-visits-and-calculator-choice-with-minimal\\\",\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-04T00:14:08.681Z\\\",\\\"updatedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-07T11:54:47.127Z\\\",\\\"archivedAt\\\":null,\\\"completedAt\\\":null,\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-07T10:10:06.397Z\\\",\\\"canceledAt\\\":null,\\\"dueDate\\\":null,\\\"slaStartedAt\\\":null,\\\"slaMediumRiskAt\\\":null,\\\"slaHighRiskAt\\\":null,\\\"slaBreachesAt\\\":null,\\\"status\\\":\\\"In Progress\\\",\\\"statusType\\\":\\\"started\\\",\\\"labels\\\":[\\\"web\\\",\\\"analytics\\\"],\\\"attachments\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"76b5361d-7b4f-43c7-99cf-dae53c587d08\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"DEV-79: Add minimal calculator events and per-request opt-out\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/164\\\"}],\\\"documents\\\":[],\\\"stateHistory\\\":[{\\\"state\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"64be05ca-3288-4616-9b5b-4d0c8d805b56\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Backlog\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"backlog\\\"},\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-04T00:14:08.681Z\\\",\\\"endedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-07T10:10:06.422Z\\\"},{\\\"state\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"b878aab7-e95e-4f74-aac1-e8693ffd9fd1\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"In Progress\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"started\\\"},\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-07T10:10:06.422Z\\\",\\\"endedAt\\\":null}],\\\"createdBy\\\":\\\"Cooper Corbett\\\",\\\"createdById\\\":\\\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\\\",\\\"assignee\\\":\\\"Cooper Corbett\\\",\\\"assigneeId\\\":\\\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\\\",\\\"project\\\":\\\"Taxkit\\\",\\\"projectId\\\":\\\"4e0eb6ef-1871-46d4-8f47-9c8f52a9c069\\\",\\\"team\\\":\\\"Development\\\",\\\"teamId\\\":\\\"ed6b68f2-2ec2-4db2-983f-bdc5951dc79a\\\",\\\"relations\\\":{\\\"blocks\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-81\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T010 — Finish rebuild checks, package versioning and controlled delivery\\\"}],\\\"blockedBy\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-75\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T004 — Build all calculator pages and the fresh package interface\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-77\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T006 — Add remote MCP and visible browser calculator tools\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-76\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T005 — Rebuild docs, search discovery, public Markdown and share images\\\"}],\\\"relatedTo\\\":[],\\\"duplicateOf\\\":null}}\"}],\"isError\":false}}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"i\":1,\"status\":\"fulfilled\",\"value\":{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"{\\\"comments\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"01822689-2dc4-401f-b8bb-049df8ce1cdc\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"Draft [#164](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/164) is ready for review of the calculator event code. Successful hosted calculations collect only the catalogue ID and name, with one shared owner for HTTP, RPC and both supported remote MCP protocols. Tax inputs and answers are excluded; denial and Do Not Track leave calculations unchanged.\\\\n\\\\nLocal root tests and builds passed on [73f2bc7](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/commit/73f2bc7d8bcdb49446e02e878a3944e7e263e8c8). Full `bun run verification` passed on [311288c](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/commit/311288c3b12c768af15e1efe4738286b56b5e506) in 680.92 seconds, including all 17 built native cases. The earlier reload fixture failure and its correction are retained in the [receipt](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/bea4539137e14844dff3732691c856a19353f626/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-analytics-backend-and-request-policy.json). Final documentation-only checks passed and all 1,770 other frozen identities matched. Checks ran locally because GitHub Actions credits are exhausted.\\\\n\\\\nDEV-79 remains In Progress. Controlled browser tests found that PostHog SDK 1.438.2 can send waiting and retried events after Do Not Track turns on. Cooper’s concrete sender choice is pending; independent relay and provider preparation can continue. Browser collection, Website opt-out forwarding, retained project setup, scoped credentials, stored-event proof and privacy/operations documentation remain unfinished. Local development and ordinary Preview collection stay off. No PostHog provider or credential change, analytics deployment, merge or publication has happened. Metrics remain deferred.\\\",\\\"attachments\\\":[],\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-07T11:55:05.613Z\\\",\\\"updatedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-07T11:55:05.576Z\\\",\\\"parentId\\\":null,\\\"resolvedAt\\\":null,\\\"quotedText\\\":null,\\\"author\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Cooper Corbett\\\"},\\\"onBehalfOf\\\":null}],\\\"hasNextPage\\\":false}\"}],\"isError\":false}}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"i\":2,\"status\":\"fulfilled\",\"value\":{\"chunk_id\":\"59c83a\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000006,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":2595,\"output\":\"packages/infrastructure/src/retired-stack.schemas.ts\\npackages/infrastructure/src/apps-secrets.boundary.ts\\npackages/infrastructure/src/apps-stack.test.ts\\npackages/infrastructure/src/cloudflare/website.test.ts\\npackages/infrastructure/src/cloudflare/website.ts\\npackages/infrastructure/src/apps-stack.ts\\npackages/infrastructure/src/stage.ts\\npackages/infrastructure/src/native-domains-provider.boundary.test.ts\\napps/web/src/router.tsx\\napps/web/src/routes/$.tsx\\napps/web/src/routes/agents.tsx\\napps/web/src/routes/search.tsx\\napps/web/src/routes/calculators.$calculatorId.tsx\\napps/web/src/routes/__root.tsx\\napps/web/src/routes/index.tsx\\napps/web/src/lib/route-context.ts\\n.agents/skills/alchemy-iac/SKILL.md\\napps/web/src/lib/docs/route-boundary.ts\\napps/web/src/routeTree.gen.ts\\n.agents/skills/alchemy-iac/references/effect/posthog-analytics.md\\n.agents/skills/alchemy-iac/references/providers/posthog.md\\n.agents/skills/docs-maintainer/SKILL.md\\n.agents/skills/effect-client-wrapper/SKILL.md\\n.agents/skills/package-structure/assets/http-api/src/client/live.layer.ts.tmpl\\n.agents/skills/package-structure/assets/http-api/src/client/browser.layer.ts.tmpl\\n.agents/skills/package-structure/assets/http-api/src/client/service.ts.tmpl\\n.agents/skills/effect-client-wrapper/agents/openai.yaml\\n.agents/skills/effect-client-wrapper/references/posthog-browser.md\\n.agents/skills/strict-effect-ts/references/transports/http-rpc-and-serialization.md\\n.agents/skills/strict-effect-ts/references/transports/persistence-and-transactions.md\\n.agents/skills/strict-effect-ts/references/transports/filesystem-process-and-platform.md\\n.agents/skills/strict-effect-ts/references/examples/format-selected-client.md\\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:54:- PostHog traffic and calculator-name events, without calculation details or\\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:95:browser pageview -> private PostHog browser service -> bounded Website relay\\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:96:successful hosted calculation -> API application event owner -> PostHog capture\\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:142:analytics or calculation Schemas. Browser WebMCP calls the visible page\\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:221:| Measurement | Agreed in Q8 and expanded by Cooper's latest message | PostHog visits and calculator names; Axiom logs, traces and metrics in the existing shared datasets; no calculation details or consent dialog | Event ownership, privacy checks, identity filters and retained provider resources |\\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:229:Q1–Q13 are settled. The broader analytics request supersedes the earlier\\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:278:| CSF-008 | Measure only traffic and chosen calculator usage in PostHog | Explicit pageview and successful calculator-use events pass a closed Schema allowlist after SDK enrichment. No figures, facts, result details, free text, user profiles, session recordings or automatic click capture. No consent dialog. Respect Do Not Track; proposed browser identity is memory-only. |\\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:337:unlimited fallback. Rate identity is not an analytics visitor ID and must not\\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:346:is redacted and cannot use the ordinary Schema encoder. No analytics identity\\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:516:## Product analytics\\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:528:packages remain free of analytics; browser buttons and transport adapters do\\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:529:not emit a second usage event. A checked collection-policy flag carries a\\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:535:recalculation. Local package calculations do not send analytics. Visits are\\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:538:Manage retained TaxKit Production and one shared Preview PostHog project through\\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:540:actual organisation/credentials in the reviewed provider plan. Local analytics\\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:555:Keep explicitly configured-off analytics distinct from invalid configuration:\\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:562:analytics exception to separate machine routes. Fix its regional upstream,\\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:605:| Calculation log | `taxkit.calculation`: calculator ID, checked outcome and duration | One API application operation, separate from product analytics. Do not log facts, values or report contents. |\\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:609:| Calculation counter/histogram | `taxkit.calculations`, unit calculation; `taxkit.calculation.duration`, unit ms | Named calculation operation start to success/failure/cancellation, excluding PostHog/export delivery. |\\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:614:Browser pageviews remain PostHog's separate measurement. Qualify observable\\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:683:add minimal PostHog and safe shared Axiom telemetry, then qualify the complete\\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:704:| `alchemy.run.ts`, `packages/infrastructure`, `tools/docs-deployment/**`, deployment workflows and infrastructure README | Change required | Same-stage native pair, new graph admission, exact DNS/secrets/analytics/telemetry ownership in T003/T007/T008/T009. Current Alchemy types/tests and reviewed plans; retain ordinary native commands over a parallel verification framework. |\\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:705:| `docs/runbooks/{docs-deployment,recovery}.md`, operations authority model, `tools/documentation/runbook-contract.json` and router pointers | Change required | Replace the one-DocsWebsite procedures with exact pair/domain/secret/analytics/signal plans and recovery in the owning slice. Revise any changed procedure target/command contract together. Docs/runbook checks plus authorised independent readback. |\\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:782:[The separate analytics/telemetry/image research](../documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-03-measurement-versions.json)\\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:784:1.435.8, Distilled PostHog/Axiom rc.13 and Takumi 2.14.0. Alchemy beta.80\\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:785:has native Axiom resources; PostHog still needs a small private custom\\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:793:Exact [PostHog source](https://registry.npmjs.org/posthog-js/-/posthog-js-1.435.8.tgz)\\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md:812:capacity, token, PostHog organisation or `taxkit.dev` provider state has been\\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:98:      \\\"surface\\\": \\\"Alchemy/secrets/domain/analytics/telemetry resources\\\",\\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:108:        \\\"CSF-T008\\\",\\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:136:        \\\"CSF-T008\\\",\\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:403:        \\\"Native plans and actual local resource state contain the explicitly disabled platform collection policy. This is bounded containment, not safe exported tracing; T009 retains that requirement.\\\"\\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:721:      \\\"id\\\": \\\"CSF-T008\\\",\\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:722:      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Implement minimal PostHog traffic and calculator analytics\\\",\\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:736:        \\\"Manage retained TaxKit Production and shared Preview projects through a private Alchemy Resource/Provider and current Distilled PostHog, with checked organisation/region/ownership and safe management failures.\\\",\\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:742:        \\\"apps/web analytics service/live adapter/consumer/relay and route event ownership\\\",\\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:743:        \\\"apps/api application successful-use capture and checked collection policy\\\",\\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:744:        \\\"packages/infrastructure PostHog provider/resources/bindings and qualified optional provider fixes\\\",\\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:777:        \\\"One backend owner emits each successful hosted calculator use; pure packages/local SDK calculations send no analytics.\\\",\\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:865:        \\\"CSF-T008\\\",\\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:872:        \\\"Update current journey inventory for each calculator path, docs/discovery, SDK consumer, remote/browser agents and analytics/telemetry privacy. Obtain one fresh independent review and reconcile material findings.\\\",\\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:902:        \\\"Run all accepted local journeys on the final source/artifact, including crawler-visible docs, calculator forms, MCP/WebMCP and analytics privacy.\\\",\\ndocs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json:903:        \\\"After explicit provider authority, verify exact Preview artifact identity and independent PostHog/Axiom readback; verify DNS/TLS/canonical www/API behaviour after any approved domain apply.\\\",\\npackages/analytics/src/service.ts:19:>()(\\\"@taxkit/analytics/BackendAnalytics\\\") {}\\npackages/analytics/src/service.ts:20:export class BrowserAnalytics extends Context.Service<\\npackages/analytics/src/service.ts:21:  BrowserAnalytics,\\npackages/analytics/src/service.ts:31:>()(\\\"@taxkit/analytics/BrowserAnalytics\\\") {}\\npackages/analytics/src/schemas.ts:8:export const PostHogProjectId = Schema.Int.check(Schema.isGreaterThan(0)).pipe(\\npackages/analytics/src/schemas.ts:9:  Schema.brand(\\\"taxkit/PostHogProjectId\\\")\\npackages/analytics/src/schemas.ts:11:export type PostHogProjectId = typeof PostHogProjectId.Type;\\npackages/analytics/src/schemas.ts:22:  projectId: PostHogProjectId,\\npackages/analytics/src/schemas.ts:34:        \\\"The analytics environment must match its checked deployment stage.\\\",\\npackages/analytics/src/test.layer.ts:4:import { BackendAnalytics, BrowserAnalytics } from \\\"./service.js\\\";\\npackages/analytics/src/test.layer.ts:25:export const makeBrowserAnalyticsTest = Effect.gen(function* () {\\npackages/analytics/src/test.layer.ts:29:      BrowserAnalytics,\\npackages/analytics/src/test.layer.ts:30:      BrowserAnalytics.of({\\npackages/analytics/src/test.layer.ts:32:        recordPageView: Effect.fn(\\\"BrowserAnalytics.recordPageView\\\")(\\n\"}}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a11571-1a58-7282-903b-860cd96057b2","create_time":1791374107.159881}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
