tive Preview and Production\\ndeployment authority from this Mac, subject to the qualification above. Keep\\nLinear activity, status and evidence aligned with actual results.\\n\\nNext continuation milestone: continue T008's accepted analytics work. The private\\nbackend and API collection owner have focused local proof; Website/browser,\\nrelay and retained provider resources remain. T007's\\noperational handover is locally accepted and ready for draft review. T006 is locally accepted and ready for\\ndraft review with its documented five-second modern cancellation limit. All three calculator\\npages have local native/browser proof. T003's connection/containment\\nqualification is locally accepted. T002's\\ninstalled dependency graph, app/script/SDK/infrastructure\\ndocs/architecture/package-ownership.md:28:- `packages/analytics`\\ndocs/architecture/package-ownership.md:189:`packages/analytics`\\ndocs/architecture/package-ownership.md:195:  projects. Calculators, rules and the local SDK have no analytics dependency.\\napps/web/README.md:108:The native analytics test uses the freshly built API and a controlled local\\napps/web/README.md:114:stays off. See the [API candidate owner](../api/README.md#analytics-candidate)\\napps/web/README.md:115:and [dated receipt](../../docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-analytics-backend-and-request-policy.json).\\ndocs/architecture/effect-services.md:20:The private [analytics package](../../packages/analytics/README.md) owns the\\napps/api/README.md:89:## Analytics candidate\\napps/api/README.md:91:`src/calculator-analytics.layer.ts` adds one application owner after a native\\napps/api/README.md:94:pure tax packages and local SDK calls have no analytics dependency. Metadata,\\napps/api/README.md:96:collect at most 64 successes; excess analytics are dropped without changing\\napps/api/README.md:99:`src/analytics-request.boundary.ts` reads the optional collection header once.\\napps/api/README.md:106:[analytics 