", \"apps/web/src/lib/calculator.atoms.ts\", \"apps/web/src/lib/live.server.layer.ts\", \"apps/web/test/native-analytics.boundary.test.ts\", \"tools/oxlint/analytics-boundaries.test.ts\", \"oxlint.config.ts\"], \"exitCode\": 0, \"durationSeconds\": 0.41, \"log\": \"/private/tmp/dev79-policy-fifth-lint.log\"}\n{\"stage\": \"native-build\", \"command\": [\"bun\", \"run\", \"--filter=web\", \"build:native-pair\"], \"exitCode\": 0, \"durationSeconds\": 20.13, \"log\": \"/private/tmp/dev79-policy-fifth-native-build.log\"}\n{\"stage\": \"native\", \"command\": [\"bun\", \"run\", \"--filter=web\", \"test:native-pair\", \"--\", \"test/native-analytics.boundary.test.ts\"], \"exitCode\": 0, \"durationSeconds\": 8.46, \"log\": \"/private/tmp/dev79-policy-fifth-native.log\"}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":28,"nanos":976670875},"formatted_output":"{\"stage\": \"format\", \"command\": [\"node_modules/.bin/oxfmt\", \"apps/web/test/native-analytics.boundary.test.ts\"], \"exitCode\": 0, \"durationSeconds\": 0.06, \"log\": \"/private/tmp/dev79-policy-fifth-format.log\"}\n{\"stage\": \"lint\", \"command\": [\"node_modules/.bin/oxlint\", \"packages/analytics/src\", \"apps/api/src/analytics-request.boundary.ts\", \"apps/api/src/worker.application.ts\", \"apps/api/test/analytics-request.boundary.test.ts\", \"apps/web/src/lib/calculator-policy.browser.layer.ts\", \"apps/web/src/lib/calculator.atoms.ts\", \"apps/web/src/lib/live.server.layer.ts\", \"apps/web/test/native-analytics.boundary.test.ts\", \"tools/oxlint/analytics-boundaries.test.ts\", \"oxlint.config.ts\"], \"exitCode\": 0, \"durationSeconds\": 0.41, \"log\": \"/private/tmp/dev79-policy-fifth-lint.log\"}\n{\"stage\": \"native-build\", \"command\": [\"bun\", \"run\", \"--filter=web\", \"build:native-pair\"], \"exitCode\": 0, \"durationSeconds\": 20.13, \"log\": \"/private/tmp/dev79-policy-fifth-native-build.log\"}\n{\"stage\": \"native\", \"command\": [\"bun\", \"run\", \"--filter=web\", \"test:native-pair\", \"--\", \"test/native-analytics.boundary.test.ts\"], \"exitCode\": 0, \"durationSeconds\": 8.46, \"log\": \"/private/tmp/dev79-policy-fifth-native.log\"}\n"},"started_at_ms":1791374626760,"completed_at_ms":1791374655736}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T12:05:08.778Z","ordinal":69970,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_02692a5b008ee3bd016ac6353c449c87d0b0e7bc2fce2fb943","status":"completed","call_id":"call_Xrw0DyWHT9ZnmQV90N5UNvrt","name":"exec","input":"text(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"python3 - <<'PY'\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\nimport hashlib,json\\np=Path('packages/analytics/package-structure.render.json');data=json.loads(p.read_text());data['configDigests']['package.json']=hashlib.sha256(Path('packages/analytics/package.json').read_bytes()).hexdigest();p.write_text(json.dumps(data,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\\np=Path('packages/analytics/README.md');s=p.read_text();s=s.replace('- `./service`: public Effect service contract.','- `./collection-policy`: one checked incoming-header policy used by the API and Website. Missing allows direct clients; malformed or denied flags and `DNT: 1` refuse collection.\\\\n- `./service`: public Effect service contract.');p.write_text(s)\\np=Path('apps/api/README.md');s=p.read_text().replace('`src/analytics-request.boundary.ts` reads the optional collection header once.','`src/analytics-request.boundary.ts` uses the private analytics package’s shared\\\\nheader boundary to read the optional collection choice once.');s=s.replace('Website opt-out forwarding, browser SDK privacy, retained provider projects and\\\\nstored UUID readback still require their remaining tests and separately\\\\nqualified provider journey.','The Website forwards a fresh browser preference or original HTML request choice\\\\nto this same boundary. Its built-pair proof is recorded in the\\\\n[Website policy receipt](../../docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-website-calculator-collection-policy.json).\\\\nBrowser sender privacy, retained provider projects and stored UUID readback\\\\nstill require their remaining tests and separately qualified provider journey.');p.write_text(s)\\np=Path('apps/web/README.md');s=p.read_text();s=s.replace('credentials or service. The Website\\\\'s browser adapter, relay and opt-out\\\\nforwarding remain T008 work in progress; ordinary local/Preview collection\\\\nstays off.','credentials or service. The built pair additionally checks fresh browser and\\\\nHTML collection choices. Ordinary local/Preview collection stays off. The\\\\npageview sender and relay remain T008 work in progress.');s+='''\\\\n\\\\n## Calculator collection choice\\\\n\\\\nThe browser calculator HttpClient reads `navigator.doNotTrack` at each actual\\\\nrequest. `1` refuses collection; recognised unset/allow values permit it. A\\\\nmissing or refusing browser host or an unexpected value refuses collection\\\\nwithout changing the tax request. Manual calculation and visible browser tools\\\\nuse the same existing Atom client, so neither path sends a second usage event.\\\\nThis adds no identity or storage and does not implement the pending pageview sender.\\\\n\\\\nHTML form calculation reads the original request through the shared private\\\\nanalytics header boundary. `DNT: 1` overrides allow, malformed and denied flags\\\\nrefuse collection, and a missing flag keeps ordinary HTML use compatible. Each\\\\nprivate request carries only the checked allow/deny flag, alongside its existing\\\\nrate admission; it never forwards browser identity. A missing server request\\\\nrefuses collection. Settings/catalogue lookups emit no calculator-use event.\\\\nThe [dated receipt](../../docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-website-calculator-collection-policy.json)\\\\nseparates controlled native/browser proof from provider ingestion or deployment.\\\\n''';p.write_text(s)\\np=Path('docs/architecture/api-and-sdk.md');s=p.read_text().replace('Its checked collection header carries allow/deny without browser identity and','The Website supplies fresh browser or original HTML preferences through the\\\\nshared private header boundary. Its checked flag carries allow/deny without browser identity and');p.write_text(s)\\np=Path('docs/architecture/frontend.md');s=p.read_text();s+='''\\\\n\\\\n## Calculator collection preference\\\\n\\\\nThe existing calculator Atom runtime composes a native HttpClient policy Layer\\\\nthat reads Do Not Track at each outgoing request. It carries only allow/deny to\\\\nthe backend owner, and catches missing, refusing or malformed browser preferences\\\\nas denial without blocking calculation. Visible browser tools share this same\\\\nclient. HTML calculation derives its policy from the original request in the\\\\nserver client, using the analytics package’s single header boundary. It does\\\\nnot retain the first visitor’s choice when the server client is reused. No\\\\nbrowser identity, storage or duplicate calculator event is added.\\\\nThe [Website owner](../../apps/web/README.md#calculator-collection-choice) routes\\\\nthe exact built-pair evidence and pending pageview sender work.\\\\n''';p.write_text(s)\\np=Path('docs/architecture/effect-services.md');s=p.read_text().replace('The application owns when to capture and which checked collection policy applies.','The package’s collection-header boundary is reused by the API and Website.\\\\nThe browser calculator transport reads its native preference at dispatch, and\\\\nthe server transport reads the current original request; neither freezes policy\\\\nwhen its Layer is built. Missing server/browser hosts refuse collection.\\\\nThe application owns when to capture and which checked collection policy applies.');p.write_text(s)\\np=Path('docs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md');s=p.read_text();s+='''\\\\n\\\\n### T008 Website calculator preference candidate\\\\n\\\\nDraft [#164](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/164) contains the locally\\\\nqualified backend source. The next attached slice closes Website preference\\\\nforwarding independently of the pending browser pageview sender decision. One\\\\nprivate header boundary is shared with the API; browser requests read native\\\\nDo Not Track at each dispatch, and HTML requests read their original headers.\\\\nThe same existing Atom client serves manual and visible-tool calculation.\\\\nRefusing/missing browser hosts, unexpected preference values and missing server\\\\nrequest contexts refuse collection without changing the calculation request.\\\\n\\\\nThe expanded native analytics fixture uses real built API and Website modules,\\\\nChromium and synthetic capture settings. Exact two-line lint exemptions admit\\\\nonly changing the native browser preference getter and throwing its controlled\\\\nrefusal; ordinary object mutation and native throws remain forbidden elsewhere.\\\\nAll orchestration stays in Effect scopes. The\\\\n[dated receipt](../../documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-website-calculator-collection-policy.json)\\\\nowns candidate identities, actual checks and remaining proof.\\\\n\\\\nDocumentation impact: **Change required** for the shared export/README, API and\\\\nWebsite owners, frontend/API/Effect architecture, exact lint configuration and\\\\nfixtures, this plan and its proof. **Preserve** the accepted sender SPEC pending\\\\nCooper’s choice, pure tax/SDK contracts, public documentation content, private\\\\nprovider credentials and all five runbook procedures. **N/A** for a Changeset:\\\\nonly a private package and private apps change; published package closure is\\\\nunchanged. No provider, credential, deployment, merge or publication occurs.\\\\nMetrics remain deferred; T008 remains in progress.\\\\n''';p.write_text(s)\\nreceipt={\\n 'documentType':'qualification-receipt','lifecycle':'evidence','authority':'supporting','owner':'taxkit-analytics-owner','observedAt':'2026-10-07','task':'CSF-T008','outcome':'candidate-pending-checks','repository':'crcorbett/taxkit','branch':'codex/dev-79-website-collection-choice','baseCommit':'bea4539137e14844dff3732691c856a19353f626','authorisedPrincipal':'Cooper Corbett','authorityBasis':'Approved clean-slate implementation continuation; no provider operation in this slice.',\\n 'changedOwners':['packages/analytics/src/collection-policy.boundary.ts','packages/analytics/src/schemas.ts','packages/analytics/package.json','apps/api/src/analytics-request.boundary.ts','apps/web/src/lib/calculator-policy.browser.layer.ts','apps/web/src/lib/live.server.layer.ts','apps/web/src/lib/calculator.atoms.ts'],\\n 'postconditions':['The API and HTML Website use one checked header policy; DNT 1 overrides allow and malformed flags deny.','Browser calculations read current native Do Not Track at dispatch; refused, missing or unexpected host values deny without failing calculation.','Visible browser tools share the existing calculator Atom client; no identity or extra calculator-use event owner is added.','No persistent browser storage or PostHog browser sender is introduced.'],\\n 'documentationImpact':{'changeRequired':['private analytics exports/README/render receipt','API and Website READMEs','frontend, API and Effect architecture','exact decoder/fetch permissions and actual-command rejection fixtures','active plan and dated evidence'],'preserve':['accepted browser sender SPEC pending human decision','pure tax and published SDK contracts','public accepted content','provider credentials and retained resources','five runbook procedures','deferred metrics'],'notApplicable':{'changeset':'Private package/app changes leave the published package closure unchanged.','providerReadback':'No provider mutation or deployment in this slice.'}},\\n 'checks':[], 'limitations':['Local controlled upstream observes transport only; no stored-event UUID or PostHog project ownership claim.','Browser pageview sender decision is pending; no accepted design change inferred.','Local and ordinary Preview analytics remain off.','Built native tests remain unqualified until the exact candidate run passes.'],\\n 'rollback':'Return to base commit bea4539137e14844dff3732691c856a19353f626; no external resource to revoke.'}\\nPath('docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-website-calculator-collection-policy.json').write_text(json.dumps(receipt,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\\nPY\",max_output_tokens:500}));\ntext(await tools.write_stdin({session_id:98778,chars:\"\",yield_time_ms:1000,max_output_tokens:2600}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a11571-1a58-7282-903b-860cd96057b2","create_time":1791374650.091055}}}
